        "created_at": "2014-06-24T12:33:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In it's current state, it won't if a Flagship plays a Mission card, but will if a Station card does. The card goes back to a time when playing a Mission card wasn't part of the TRIBA. At that point, the T would always work. This may have just been a situation where the card wasn't updated.</p>",
